    <section class="demo__panel">
      <h2>Architecture (short)</h2>
      <pre class="demo__code">{`WordPress + Elementor (today)
        │ export HTML (WP Rocket)
        ▼
Astro static site
  /              → Phase 1 HTML mirror (SEO tags baked in)
  /demo/seo      → Phase 3+ model (SEO from YAML)
  build          → sitemap.xml + robots.txt
        │
        ▼
CDN / static host (no PHP)`}</pre>
